# ─── macOS / Windows ───────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# ─── Env files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Real env files are never committed. The `.example` templates ARE
# committed — they're what the READMEs tell you to copy from, so
# they have to survive the `.env*` rule that hides the real thing.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

